  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, sauté the diced Canadian bacon over medium heat until browned.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrots, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the red lentils, beef broth, water, salt, and pepper to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Stir in the mashed potatoes and cook for an additional 10-15 minutes, or until the potatoes are heated through.",
